Exactly two resident skills: constitution and this role's core. Keep all other skills lazy; do not read the roster or full spec on boot. The detailed V4 spec is available on demand at docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-06-aperture-v4-project-teams-design.md. Source/merge/setup/session adoption are separate facts.
